Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:00.11,屏字 - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,0)\blur2\pos(947,403)}判处勇者刑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:00.11,屏字 - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,00)\fs40\c&H858B9D&\2c&H061437&\blur8\3c&H071434&\pos(1271,836)}刑 罚 勇 者 9 0 0 4 队 服 刑 记 录
